# ZP-PRIV F07 / E06 change control.
#
# Changes to authorization, identity, tenant isolation, audit and the privacy
# evidence need a review from the privacy reviewers, must pass the
# privacy-isolation CI job, and invalidate any prior privacy attestation
# (scripts/run_privacy_attestation.py compares these paths against
# attestation.reviewed_git_sha in docs/privacy/control_register.yaml).
#
# The team below must exist in the GitHub organization and branch protection
# must require code-owner review (human proof HP-10).

